    title: 'Indian Food in the Netherlands  -  A Personal Guide for 2025',
    metaTitle: 'Indian Food Netherlands | Complete Guide to Indian Cuisine in NL',
    metaDescription: 'Your complete guide to Indian food in the Netherlands  -  the best cities, what to order, halal options, vegetarian dishes and where to find authentic cuisine.',
    h1: 'Indian Food in the Netherlands  -  A Complete Guide for 2026',
    primaryKeyword: 'Indian food Netherlands',
